{"displayStem":"생후 7일 남아가 수유가 줄고 처져서 병원에 왔다. 같은 저울로 측정한 체중 기록을 가져왔다. 임신나이에 맞는 만삭 출생아이며 신체 기형은 알려져 있지 않다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"자료는 독립적으로 작성한 교육용 모의자료이다."}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence \"><div class=\"evidence\"><div class=\"measurement-panels\"><figure class=\"measurement-panel\"><figcaption>연속 체중 기록</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 580 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"연속 체중 기록。생후 일수 (day)、체중 (kg)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"580\" height=\"355\" fill=\"white\"></rect><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"526\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"20\" y=\"25\">체중 (kg)</text><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"76\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"186\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"186\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"186\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><line x1=\"296\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"296\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"296\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><line x1=\"406\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"406\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"406\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text><line x1=\"516\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"516\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"516\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"234\" text-anchor=\"end\">2.7</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"185.49999999999997\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"185.49999999999997\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"190.49999999999997\" text-anchor=\"end\">2.93</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"141.99999999999994\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"141.99999999999994\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"146.99999999999994\" text-anchor=\"end\">3.15</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"98.50000000000003\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"98.50000000000003\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"103.50000000000003\" text-anchor=\"end\">3.38</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"end\">3.6</text><polyline points=\"76,89.80000000000004 186,126.53333333333337 241,143.93333333333334 351,157.46666666666673 461,172.93333333333334\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"none\"></polyline><circle cx=\"76\" cy=\"89.80000000000004\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"186\" cy=\"126.53333333333337\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"241\" cy=\"143.93333333333334\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"351\" cy=\"157.46666666666673\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"461\" cy=\"172.93333333333334\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"301\" r=\"3\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><text x=\"97\" y=\"306\">환아</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\">생후 일수 (day)</text></svg></figure></div></div></div>","<div class=\"dataset-evidence \"><div class=\"evidence\"><table><thead><tr><th>현재 소견</th><th>결과</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>혈청 Na⁺</td><td>154mmol/L</td></tr><tr><td>수유 관찰</td><td>흡착 불량, 실제 전달량 적음</td></tr><tr><td>지난 24시간 젖은 기저귀</td><td>2개</td></tr><tr><td>활력·진찰</td><td>빈맥, 구강 건조, 반응 감소</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>"]}